As Product Creation Process Manager, you own the seasonal Rolling Program and critical path across all STICHD brands, product categories and regions. You connect the internal teams involved in product creation, ensure clear milestones and accountability, and continuously improve the processes, systems and ways of working that take our products from concept to market.


You possess in-depth knowledge of operational processes, think cross-functionally, and proactively seek ways to improve and innovate the Rolling Program and the way we work.

